# Design System

## Brand
- Primary: `#0A1F44` (dark blue) — use `bg-primary`, `text-primary`
- Accent: `#3B82F6` (blue), `#06B6D4` (cyan)
- Font: Rubik via `next/font/google`
- Headings: `font-bold` to `font-black`, large scale (`text-4xl`–`text-7xl`)

## Glass System (SINGLE SOURCE)
Use `GlassCard` from `@/components/ui/glass-card` or `glass` utility class.
Never create ad-hoc glass styles. Tokens:
- `backdrop-blur-xl`
- `bg-white/10` (dark) / `bg-white/70` (light)
- `border border-white/20`
- `shadow-glass` (custom token)
- Hover: `hover:bg-white/15`, `hover:border-white/30`

## Spacing
- Section: `py-16 md:py-24`
- Container: `max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-10`
- Gap: `gap-6` or `gap-8`

## Cards
- `rounded-2xl`, soft shadows, hover scale `1.02–1.03`
- CVA variants for buttons and badges

## Dark/Light
- CSS variables in `globals.css`; toggle via `next-themes`
- Test both modes for every new component
